      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E9EBC4E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明明該是蓬鬆得太過舒服，\n會一摸就捨不得離開才對！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E8A72662F84EC9B065F97592A904E8212670DFF0C000A67034E0064785C3163684E0D5F9796E2958B624D5C0DFF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是我家的胖可丁，\n牠的毛皮不只硬梆梆還臭烘烘的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F62115BB6768480D653EF4E01FF0C000A726076846BDB76AE4E0D53EA786C68866886908481ED70D870D87684FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "會那樣是因為\n牠非常討厭洗澡。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670390A36A23662F56E070BA000A7260975E5E388A0E53AD6D176FA1300200100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是我想到了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我要假裝打對戰，\n趁機用泡沫光線讓牠洗澡！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F621160F352304E86300200100001BE01000A62118981504788DD62535C0D6230FF0C000A8D816A5F75286CE16CAB51497DDA8B9372606D176FA1FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把學會了泡沫光線的寶可夢\n放進同行隊伍吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n準備好了的話，就跟我說一聲！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A5B7867034E866CE16CAB51497DDA76845BF653EF5922000A653E9032540C884C968A4F0D5427FF0100100001BE00000A6E965099597D4E8676848A71FF0C5C318DDF62118AAA4E008072FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了讓胖可丁變得乾乾淨淨，\n把學會了泡沫光線的寶可夢<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n放進同行隊伍裡帶來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E868B9380D653EF4E018B8A5F974E7E4E7E6DE86DE8FF0C000A628A5B7867034E866CE16CAB51497DDA76845BF653EF592200100001BE00000A653E9032540C884C968A4F0D88E15E364F865427FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把學會了泡沫光線的寶可夢\n放進同行隊伍裡帶來了呢！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n可以假裝和我來一場對戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3628A5B7867034E866CE16CAB51497DDA76845BF653EF5922000A653E9032540C884C968A4F0D88E15E364F864E865462FF0100100001BE00000A53EF4EE5504788DD548C62114F864E0058345C0D623055CEFF1F00100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來洗澡吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F866D176FA15427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的胖可丁\n不只硬梆梆還臭烘烘的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211768480D653EF4E01000A4E0D53EA786C68866886908481ED70D870D87684FF0100100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幫我用泡沫光線\n讓胖可丁變得閃亮亮的吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
