      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難道是因為……牠討厭我老是亂摸牠，\n所以才把毛皮弄髒的嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E39053662F56E070BA2026202672608A0E53AD62118001662F4E8264787260FF0C000A62404EE5624D628A6BDB76AE5F049AD2768455CEFF1F00100002011401D70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "喂～！\n等等～等等啦，胖可丁！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǗ",
